<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 69,8050 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 69,8050 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 69.8050 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 69.7907 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 16		  Oct 15</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     69.8050		 69.7907</p>
<p> volume ($ million)	    0.635		   1.290</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
